                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an oenological manner; with regard to the study of wine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77ebd1dc-1e65-4abc-8c30-7a5b56d55641",
                                                "sense_id": "ed4e4115-a373-3db5-9a14-37a3e09f00c5",
                                                "text": "Vouvray thus permitted the Canard staff to demarcate themselves not only from the world of oenologically ignorant foreigners (and hence, to reaffirm their Frenchness) but also from that of official celebrations with their pomposity and hypocrisy."
